From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:06:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] powerpc: mpc85xx: relocate remaining simpleImage devices

Link the simpleImage loader of HiveAP-330, BR200-WP, WS-AP3710i,
WS-AP3715i and WS-AP3825i at 0x3000000, so their kernels no longer
exceed the space available below the loader.

Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
---
--- a/arch/powerpc/boot/wrapper
+++ b/arch/powerpc/boot/wrapper
@@ -350,10 +350,15 @@ adder875-redboot)
     ;;
 simpleboot-br200-wp|\
 simpleboot-hiveap-330|\
-simpleboot-tl-wdr4900-v1|\
 simpleboot-ws-ap3710i|\
+simpleboot-ws-ap3715i|\
 simpleboot-ws-ap3825i)
     platformo="$object/fixed-head.o $object/simpleboot.o"
+    link_address='0x3000000'
+    binary=y
+    ;;
+simpleboot-tl-wdr4900-v1)
+    platformo="$object/fixed-head.o $object/simpleboot.o"
     link_address='0x1500000'
     binary=y
     ;;
